{"seq":4,"slug":"parallel-execution","title":"并行执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/parallel-execution","wordCount":875,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"并行执行\">并行执行</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>并行执行</strong>利用任务间的无依赖关系同时运行多个任务，其边界由三个概念界定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并行度</td>\n<td>同时运行的任务数量上限</td>\n<td>由 <code>--concurrency</code> 控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键路径</td>\n<td>依赖图中最长的链条</td>\n<td>总构建时间的理论下界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发约束</td>\n<td>CPU 核数、内存等资源限制</td>\n<td>决定并行度不能无限提高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心权衡是<strong>速度与资源</strong>：并行度越高，构建越快，但内存和 CPU 压力越大，CI 机器资源通常比本地更有限，因此并发数需按环境调整。而无论并行度多高，总时间都不可能低于关键路径长度——这决定了优化的重点应放在&quot;缩短关键路径上的包&quot;，而非盲目提高并发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并行执行的价值\">并行执行的价值</h2><p>Monorepo 中的许多任务天然可以并行化。当拓扑排序将任务分为多个批次后，同一批次内的任务之间没有依赖关系，可以同时执行。在一台 8 核 CPU 的机器上，理论上可以同时运行 8 个构建任务。<strong>并行执行</strong>（Parallel Execution）就是充分利用这种并行度，将总构建时间从所有任务的线性累加压缩到关键路径的长度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title 串行 vs 并行执行&#10;    dateFormat X&#10;    axisFormat %s&#10;&#10;    section 串行执行&#10;    types       :a1, 0, 2&#10;    config      :a2, 2, 4&#10;    utils       :a3, 4, 7&#10;    ui          :a4, 7, 11&#10;    web         :a5, 11, 15&#10;    admin       :a6, 15, 19&#10;&#10;    section 并行执行&#10;    types       :b1, 0, 2&#10;    config      :b2, 0, 2&#10;    utils       :b3, 2, 5&#10;    ui          :b4, 5, 9&#10;    web         :b5, 9, 13&#10;    admin       :b6, 9, 13\">gantt\n    title 串行 vs 并行执行\n    dateFormat X\n    axisFormat %s\n\n    section 串行执行\n    types       :a1, 0, 2\n    config      :a2, 2, 4\n    utils       :a3, 4, 7\n    ui          :a4, 7, 11\n    web         :a5, 11, 15\n    admin       :a6, 15, 19\n\n    section 并行执行\n    types       :b1, 0, 2\n    config      :b2, 0, 2\n    utils       :b3, 2, 5\n    ui          :b4, 5, 9\n    web         :b5, 9, 13\n    admin       :b6, 9, 13</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"turborepo-的并发控制\">Turborepo 的并发控制</h2><p>Turborepo 默认会尽可能并行执行任务，但可以通过 <code>--concurrency</code> 参数控制并发数量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 默认：使用可用 CPU 核心数的 100%&#10;// turbo run build&#10;&#10;// 限制并发数&#10;// turbo run build --concurrency=4&#10;&#10;// 使用 CPU 核心数的百分比&#10;// turbo run build --concurrency=50%&#10;&#10;// 只串行执行（调试用）&#10;// turbo run build --concurrency=1&#10;&#10;// 并行执行无依赖的 dev 任务&#10;// turbo run dev --parallel\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 默认：使用可用 CPU 核心数的 100%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 限制并发数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --concurrency=4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 CPU 核心数的百分比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --concurrency=50%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只串行执行（调试用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --concurrency=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 并行执行无依赖的 dev 任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run dev --parallel</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: []&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;persistent&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"persistent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>&quot;dependsOn&quot;: []</code> 意味着 <code>lint</code> 任务不依赖任何其他任务，可以与 <code>build</code> 的第一批次同时开始执行，最大化并行度。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"资源限制与内存管理\">资源限制与内存管理</h2><p>并行执行虽然提升了速度，但也增加了内存和 CPU 压力。特别是在 CI 环境中，资源通常比开发者本地机器更有限：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Node.js 内存限制&#10;// NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=4096 turbo run build&#10;&#10;// TypeScript 编译器内存优化&#10;{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;incremental&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;skipLibCheck&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;disableReferencedProjectLoad&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Node.js 内存限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=4096 turbo run build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TypeScript 编译器内存优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"incremental\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"skipLibCheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"disableReferencedProjectLoad\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;turbo run build --concurrency=50%&quot;,&#10;    &quot;build:ci&quot;: &quot;turbo run build --concurrency=2&quot;,&#10;    &quot;test:ci&quot;: &quot;turbo run test --concurrency=1&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run build --concurrency=50%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build:ci\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run build --concurrency=2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test:ci\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run test --concurrency=1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环境</th>\n<th>推荐并发数</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发者本地</td>\n<td>CPU 核心数</td>\n<td>资源充足，最大化速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI（标准）</td>\n<td>2-4</td>\n<td>CI 机器通常 2-4 核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI（大型）</td>\n<td>4-8</td>\n<td>高配 CI 机器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存受限</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>避免 OOM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ci-矩阵优化\">CI 矩阵优化</h2><p>对于大型 Monorepo，可以使用 <strong>CI 矩阵</strong>（Matrix Strategy）将不同包的构建分散到多个 CI 作业中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/ci.yml&#10;name: CI Matrix&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  detect:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    outputs:&#10;      packages: ${{ steps.affected.outputs.packages }}&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - id: affected&#10;        run: |&#10;          PACKAGES=$(pnpm turbo run build --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD] --dry-run=json | jq -c &#39;[.tasks[].package] | unique&#39;)&#10;          echo &quot;packages=$PACKAGES&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT&#10;&#10;  build:&#10;    needs: detect&#10;    if: needs.detect.outputs.packages != &#39;[]&#39;&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        package: ${{ fromJson(needs.detect.outputs.packages) }}&#10;      fail-fast: false&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm turbo run build test lint --filter=${{ matrix.package }}...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CI Matrix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  detect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    outputs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ steps.affected.outputs.packages }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">affected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          PACKAGES=$(pnpm turbo run build --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD] --dry-run=json | jq -c '[.tasks[].package] | unique')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"packages=$PACKAGES\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">detect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">needs.detect.outputs.packages != '[]'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ fromJson(needs.detect.outputs.packages) }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      fail-fast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm turbo run build test lint --filter=${{ matrix.package }}...</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PR[PR 提交] --&gt; DETECT[检测受影响的包]&#10;    DETECT --&gt; MATRIX[生成构建矩阵]&#10;    MATRIX --&gt; J1[Job: @myorg/utils]&#10;    MATRIX --&gt; J2[Job: @myorg/ui]&#10;    MATRIX --&gt; J3[Job: @myorg/web]&#10;    J1 &amp; J2 &amp; J3 --&gt; MERGE[合并结果]\">flowchart TD\n    PR[PR 提交] --&gt; DETECT[检测受影响的包]\n    DETECT --&gt; MATRIX[生成构建矩阵]\n    MATRIX --&gt; J1[Job: @myorg/utils]\n    MATRIX --&gt; J2[Job: @myorg/ui]\n    MATRIX --&gt; J3[Job: @myorg/web]\n    J1 &amp; J2 &amp; J3 --&gt; MERGE[合并结果]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"nx-的分布式任务执行\">Nx 的分布式任务执行</h2><p>Nx Cloud 提供了<strong>分布式任务执行</strong>（Distributed Task Execution，DTE），可以将一次构建的任务分散到多台 CI 机器上：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/ci.yml&#10;jobs:&#10;  main:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: npx nx-cloud start-ci-run --distribute-on=&quot;3 linux-medium-js&quot;&#10;      - run: npx nx affected -t build test lint&#10;      - run: npx nx-cloud stop-all-agents\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx nx-cloud start-ci-run --distribute-on=\"3 linux-medium-js\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx nx affected -t build test lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx nx-cloud stop-all-agents</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nx.json - DTE 配置&#10;{&#10;  &quot;nxCloudAccessToken&quot;: &quot;your-token&quot;,&#10;  &quot;parallel&quot;: 3,&#10;  &quot;cacheDirectory&quot;: &quot;.nx/cache&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nx.json - DTE 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"nxCloudAccessToken\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"your-token\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"parallel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"cacheDirectory\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".nx/cache\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"并行度与关键路径\">并行度与关键路径</h2><p>即使并行度再高，总构建时间也不可能低于<strong>关键路径</strong>（Critical Path）的长度。关键路径是依赖图中最长的链条：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;关键路径(红色)&quot;&#10;        T[&quot;types&lt;br/&gt;2s&quot;] --&gt; U[&quot;utils&lt;br/&gt;3s&quot;] --&gt; UI[&quot;ui&lt;br/&gt;4s&quot;] --&gt; W[&quot;web&lt;br/&gt;4s&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;可并行&quot;&#10;        C[&quot;config&lt;br/&gt;2s&quot;]&#10;        A[&quot;admin&lt;br/&gt;3s&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"关键路径(红色)\"\n        T[\"types&lt;br/&gt;2s\"] --&gt; U[\"utils&lt;br/&gt;3s\"] --&gt; UI[\"ui&lt;br/&gt;4s\"] --&gt; W[\"web&lt;br/&gt;4s\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"可并行\"\n        C[\"config&lt;br/&gt;2s\"]\n        A[\"admin&lt;br/&gt;3s\"]\n    end\n</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>执行方式</th>\n<th>总时间</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完全串行</td>\n<td>18s</td>\n<td>所有任务累加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大并行</td>\n<td>13s</td>\n<td>关键路径: 2+3+4+4=13s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实际并行</td>\n<td>13-15s</td>\n<td>受调度开销影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 要缩短总构建时间，最有效的方法是优化关键路径上的包——减少它们的构建时间或拆分大包降低单包构建耗时。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((并行执行))&#10;    并发控制&#10;      --concurrency&#10;      CPU 百分比&#10;      环境适配&#10;    资源管理&#10;      内存限制&#10;      skipLibCheck&#10;      CI 资源约束&#10;    CI 矩阵&#10;      矩阵策略&#10;      包级并行&#10;      fail-fast: false&#10;    分布式执行&#10;      Nx Cloud DTE&#10;      多机分散&#10;      远程协调\">mindmap\n  root((并行执行))\n    并发控制\n      --concurrency\n      CPU 百分比\n      环境适配\n    资源管理\n      内存限制\n      skipLibCheck\n      CI 资源约束\n    CI 矩阵\n      矩阵策略\n      包级并行\n      fail-fast: false\n    分布式执行\n      Nx Cloud DTE\n      多机分散\n      远程协调</pre><ul>\n<li>并行执行通过同时运行无依赖关系的任务，将构建时间压缩到关键路径的长度</li>\n<li><code>--concurrency</code> 参数控制并发数量，应根据运行环境（本地 vs CI）适当调整</li>\n<li>CI 矩阵策略将不同包的构建分散到多个作业中，适合大型 Monorepo</li>\n<li>Nx Cloud 的分布式任务执行可以跨多台 CI 机器协调构建任务</li>\n<li>优化总构建时间的关键是识别和优化关键路径上的瓶颈包</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并行执行","id":"并行执行"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"并行执行的价值","id":"并行执行的价值"},{"level":2,"text":"Turborepo 的并发控制","id":"turborepo-的并发控制"},{"level":2,"text":"资源限制与内存管理","id":"资源限制与内存管理"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 矩阵优化","id":"ci-矩阵优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Nx 的分布式任务执行","id":"nx-的分布式任务执行"},{"level":2,"text":"并行度与关键路径","id":"并行度与关键路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/incremental-builds"},"next":{"title":"包设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/package-design"}}